.SH NAME
SystemEx.Threading.RCUObject< T > \- Represents a minimal Read-Copy-Update (RCU) container that provides lock-free read access and exclusive write access to a protected value\&. Reader activity is tracked through an \fBEpoch\fP instance, while writers are synchronized using an \fBILock\fP\&.  

