.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Represents a minimal Read-Copy-Update (RCU) container that provides lock-free read access and exclusive write access to a protected value\&. Reader activity is tracked through an \fBEpoch\fP instance, while writers are synchronized using an \fBILock\fP\&. 


.PP
\fBTemplate Parameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIT\fP The type of the value being protected by the RCU object\&. 
.RE
.PP

